    <string name="dev_step_1">Press the Home key and open Settings (gear icon).</string>
    <string name="dev_step_2">Scroll down and tap Apps.</string>
    <string name="dev_step_3">Tap Health Platform (Health Sensor Service). Not listed? Tap “See all apps” first.</string>
    <string name="dev_step_4">Quickly tap the “Health Platform” title at the top about 10 times.</string>
    <string name="dev_step_5">“[Dev mode]” appears under the title. If asked, tap OK.</string>
    <string name="dev_mode_note">Tapping the title 10 times again turns it off. A watch update can switch it off; Heartline will tell you.</string>
